{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"53247bc6-15a3-4e68-a0e1-96d9b241389a","step":{"id":"s1","script":"An inscribed angle has its vertex on the circle. Its two chords meet the circle at A and B, intercepting the highlighted arc.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Inscribed angle theorem"},{"op":"figure","id":"circlefig","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-3.8,3.8],"y":[-3.7,3.7],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"circle","id":"rim","center":[0,0],"r":3},{"kind":"point","id":"a","at":[-2.598076211,1.5],"label":"A"},{"kind":"point","id":"b","at":[2.598076211,1.5],"label":"B"},{"kind":"point","id":"c","at":[0,-3],"label":"C"},{"kind":"segment","from":{"at":"c"},"to":{"at":"a"}},{"kind":"segment","from":{"at":"c"},"to":{"at":"b"}},{"kind":"arc","center":[0,0],"r":3,"start":30,"end":150,"label":"arc AB"},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"c"},"from":{"at":"b"},"to":{"at":"a"},"r":0.16,"label":"θ"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"53247bc6-15a3-4e68-a0e1-96d9b241389a","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Join the center to the same endpoints. The central angle intercepting that same arc is twice the inscribed angle.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"central","on":"circlefig","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"o","at":[0,0],"label":"O"},{"kind":"segment","from":{"at":"o"},"to":{"at":"a"}},{"kind":"segment","from":{"at":"o"},"to":{"at":"b"}},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"o"},"from":{"at":"b"},"to":{"at":"a"},"r":0.23,"label":"2θ"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"theorem","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"\\angle ACB=\\frac12\\angle AOB"},{"op":"text","id":"condition","anchor":{"el":"theorem","side":"below","gap":0.08},"content":"Both angles intercept the same arc."}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"53247bc6-15a3-4e68-a0e1-96d9b241389a","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Here the central angle is 120 degrees, so the inscribed angle is 60 degrees. Always match the intercepted arc before halving.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"values","on":"circlefig","marks":[{"kind":"text","at":[0,1.35],"text":"120°"},{"kind":"text","at":[0,-1.95],"text":"60°"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"example","anchor":{"el":"condition","side":"below","gap":0.12},"latex":"\\theta=\\frac{120^\\circ}{2}=60^\\circ"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"If the intercepted arc measures 80°, what is the inscribed angle?","expected_gist":"40°, because an inscribed angle is half the measure of its intercepted arc."}}}
